{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0de9aa9dc5a833d927d","chatId":"fd235ac00eee484abd6ea7402b737776","sessionId":null,"userId":98880,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1487,"promptTokens":1505,"completionTokens":102,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:58"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908201929262529,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0de9aa9dc5a833d927c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482398045,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0de9aa9dc5a833d927c","chatId":"fd235ac00eee484abd6ea7402b737776","sessionId":null,"userId":98880,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n莎莎最近搬到了墨西哥工作，必须快速学会西班牙语。她上了一些课并感觉在新语言上做得还不错。在一个部门午餐会上，她试图夸赞同事的穿着，但由于记混了词，说成了“你看起来像只鸡”。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，莎莎最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 反对\nB) 尴尬\nC) 嫉妒\nD) 感激\nE) 爱护\nF) 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n莎莎为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她想用蹩脚的西班牙语来赞美她的同事\nB) 莎莎对同事的时尚感同情\nC) 莎莎因为叫她的同事胆小鬼而感到内疚\nD) 莎莎在间接地向同事寻求语言帮助","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908201929262529,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0de9aa9dc5a833d927d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482398043,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"3624842c265440b2a737623c1a129530"}